1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,250
Lesson 13.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,870
Amber comes over to bake cookies.

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:10,970
Ted's girlfriend, Amber, comes over to help with the cookies.

4
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:14,929
Amber has experienced baking cookies from a former job.

5
00:00:15,759 --> 00:00:18,169
Susan leaves the kitchen so they can work better.

6
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:21,269
Mom, Amber is here to lend a hand with the cookies.

7
00:00:21,579 --> 00:00:23,589
Hi, Amber. Nice to see you again.

8
00:00:24,399 --> 00:00:26,209
Good to see you too, Mrs. Johnson.

9
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:29,429
That's an interesting hairstyle.

10
00:00:29,919 --> 00:00:32,369
Thanks. I'm glad you think it's cool.

11
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:35,149
Blue hair is all the rage this season.

12
00:00:35,799 --> 00:00:39,490
Well, I'm going to take a break now and let you kids take over.

13
00:00:39,799 --> 00:00:42,670
Don't worry, Mom. Your business isn't good hands with Amber.

14
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:43,909
She really knows her stuff.

15
00:00:44,359 --> 00:00:47,850
That's true. I used to work at Miss Fields cookies in the mall.

16
00:00:48,399 --> 00:00:49,609
You don't work there anymore?

17
00:00:50,439 --> 00:00:51,769
No, I got fired.

18
00:00:51,619 --> 00:00:56,070
I have a real sweet tooth and they told me I was eating too many cookies.

19
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:59,089
Well, I'm sure you haven't lost your touch.

20
00:00:59,719 --> 00:01:01,750
It might be a bit out of practice.

21
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,670
Mom, you can watch Amber bake if you want.

22
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:06,430
You might pick up a few tricks to the trade.

23
00:01:06,859 --> 00:01:08,130
Yes, feel free.

24
00:01:08,599 --> 00:01:11,630
As a singer, I'm used to performing before an audience.

25
00:01:12,699 --> 00:01:14,810
Thanks, but I'm going to get out of the way.

26
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,370
You know what they say.

27
00:01:16,819 --> 00:01:18,670
Too many cooks spoil the broth.

28
00:01:19,619 --> 00:01:21,370
Will I see you later tonight?

29
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:24,050
Yes, I'll be back in a few hours.

30
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:26,630
Mom, why don't you just call it a night and go to bed.

31
00:01:26,959 --> 00:01:28,770
You've been working your tail off all day.

